            "review_title": "Review at Liberty Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Colin L\nSingapore, Singapore1004 contributions\n0\nAnother great food venue in HCMC\nMar 2014 • Business\nSo far, every Vietnamese restaurant that we have visited did not disappointed and this was no exception.\n\nWent there for lunch and was served very quickly. Food was excellent and the steam fish that we had will deserve special mention. Cooked to perfection with and garnished with spring onions, ginger and cilantro, the flesh was firm and melt in your mouth. The gravy was an excellent compliment to the bowl of steam rice.\n\nEspecially love the lime juice serve with soda water in a glass of crushed ice. A perfect thirst quencher.\n\nWill definitely visit again.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 21, 2014",
